ref 17592186045417] [17592186074903 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "65c45801-df02-5e24-9d1c-d20654b36c65" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186074903 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186075046 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186074904 #edb/ref 1058 #edb/ref 17592186074905 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186074904 #edb/ref 1061 93404 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186074904 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "300cdd9f-b0a5-526a-907d-3323aed6cfc9" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186074904 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186073901 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186074905 #edb/ref 1058 #edb/ref 17592186074906 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186074905 #edb/ref 1061 93407 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186074905 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "2868f3bf-331f-5d98-b8a2-329c0d7d3ceb" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186074905 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186073902 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186074906 #edb/ref 1061 93410 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186074906 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "29859205-5375-5c4e-971d-54f1c05b3f49" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186074906 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186073903 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186075046 #edb/ref 1064 "To divide a whole number by a unit fraction, we can multiply the whole number by the fraction's denominator.\n\nSo, to divide\n\n$$\n2 \\div \\dfrac{1}{\\color{blue}5}\n$$\n\nwe multiply the $2$ by ${\\color{blue}5}\\!$:\n\n$$\n2 \\div \\dfrac{1}{\\color{blue}5} = 2 \\times {\\color{blue}5} = 10\n$$\n\nAnd that's the answer! Notice that this method does the same job as the fraction model method we used before:\n\n![](images/5f/5f2eb6ab39ea67466d7a42a8809b8a039a84f9a20a13cca3659d81f669a772a5.png)" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186075046 #edb/ref 1065 8572 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186075046 #edb/ref 1066 #uuid "058743c7-e03e-521c-92ce-c1a5fd00663f" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186075046 #edb/ref 1067 "Introduction" #edb/ref 17592186045417]}
